    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos and video of the vehicle’s exterior, interior, wheels, and undercarriage from all angles. Upload the media to a secure cloud portal and obtain customer sign‑off. This visual record protects both the owner and the vehicle transport provider against disputes and is a standard practice among top car transport companies.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Battery Terminal Inspection:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Verify that the battery terminals are clean, tight, and free of corrosion. Use a multimeter to confirm a healthy voltage reading (12.4‑12.8 V for a fully charged 12 V system). Document the readings in the audit log; many packers and movers Allahabad crews include this step to prevent accidental discharge during transit.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the fuel level does not exceed 25 % of tank capacity. This reduces weight, minimizes fire risk, and complies with most carrier safety guidelines. If the tank is higher, arrange for a safe fuel drain or request the customer to refuel after loading.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag Management:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Confirm that the vehicle’s FASTag is either deactivated or transferred to the driver’s account, depending on the route. Record the tag number and status in the transport manifest. Proper FASTag handling avoids toll violations and streamlines the journey for any car moving service operating on Indian highways.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final Securing &amp; Documentation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">After completing the above checks, position the car on the carrier using wheel straps and anti‑scratch pads. Double‑check that all straps are tensioned correctly and that the vehicle is immobilized. Capture a final set of photos, obtain the customer’s signature on the load sheet, and hand over the keys to the driver.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>This completes the pre‑loading protocol for a reliable car transport service near me</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="content-ui-section" style="padding: 55px 0; background: #0b132b; color: #cbd5e1; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1060px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px 32px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);">
      <span style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">HANDOVER INSPECTION</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Car Transportation In Allahabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>At the destination, the delivery handover of each automobile follows a strict, three‑step protocol designed to guarantee that the vehicle’s condition, mileage, and paperwork remain unchanged from pickup to delivery.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Condition Re‑Inspection</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The receiving driver and a senior quality‑control inspector walk the vehicle in natural daylight, comparing every visible surface to the high‑resolution pickup photographs stored in the transport system. Any paint chips, dents, or scratches that were not present at pickup trigger a photographic log and an immediate repair request.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The inspector marks the photo set with a timestamp and a digital signature, ensuring traceability</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer Verification Against the LR Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The vehicle’s odometer reading is recorded on a printed copy of the LR bilty and cross‑checked with the electronic logbook. The driver reads the odometer, writes the figure on a laminated “Mileage Confirmation” sheet, and the inspector signs it.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>If the reading deviates by more than 5 km from the bilty, an audit trail is created and the carrier is notified for corrective action</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Signed Condition Sign‑Off</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Once the visual inspection and mileage verification are complete, the receiver signs the “Delivery Acceptance Form.” This form captures the vehicle’s VIN, model, and any noted defects, and it is scanned into the central database.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The carrier’s transport manager also signs, confirming that the vehicle was delivered in the agreed condition</span>
  </li>
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>Both parties retain a signed PDF copy for their records</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Throughout the process, all documents are captured on a mobile device and synced to the central fleet‑management portal within 30 minutes of handover. This real‑time data flow allows the dispatch team to update the status of the vehicle, flag any discrepancies, and initiate repairs or claims immediately.</p>
<p>By enforcing daylight re‑inspection, precise odometer checks, and dual‑party sign‑off, the company ensures complete transparency, protects customer satisfaction, and reduces post‑delivery disputes.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



